        <tr><td>Zoho Books / TallyPrime / Wafeq (we set it up)</td><td>{fmt(P.help)}</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td><b>{fmt(P.help)}</b> + software costs</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <p class="small">Our fees only. Software subscriptions and any data migration are extra.</p>
      <p><b>Usually keep your software</b> if you have years of history in it and your team knows it well. <b>Consider switching</b> if your QuickBooks Desktop version is old, you want no yearly e-invoicing fee, or you were planning to change software anyway. If you switch, <a href="/switch-accounting-software">we move your data and set up e-invoicing</a>.</p>
    </section>

